# Docker build context hygiene (EP-SEALER-DEPLOY): the audit-sealer image builds with the repo
# root as context (it needs the pnpm workspace to bundle the @govai/* deps). Exclude host-specific
# and generated artifacts so the build is reproducible (pnpm install regenerates node_modules for
# the image's platform) and the context stays small.
**/node_modules
.git
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.log
